agotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hello_Kitty_Harapparatchi.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/cf/Hello_Kitty_Harapparatchi.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20240718160910","caption":"На изображении · Хараппаратчи"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamamoriNachuMori.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/08/TamamoriNachuMori.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230213061209","caption":"Наклейка Начумори Тамамори","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/08/TamamoriNachuMori.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230213061209"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamamoriKateiSaien.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e7/TamamoriKateiSaien.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230213061208","caption":"Наклейка Кэтей Сайен Тамамори","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e7/TamamoriKateiSaien.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230213061208"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamamoriFlowerHills.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9b/TamamoriFlowerHills.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20230214003820","caption":"Наклейка «Цветочные холмы Тамамори»","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/9b/TamamoriFlowerHills.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230214003820"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/28/288ecd6f04bbe60ce752.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamamoriTamaPetSalon.jpg","caption":"Тама Зоосалон"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/15/15c4f7f0f09240201bb3.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamamoriSpringConcert.jpg","caption":"Весенний концерт"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:HarapparatchiIDLSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c6/HarapparatchiIDLSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220821012536","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Хараппаратчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:HarapparatchiUniSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8c/HarapparatchiUniSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230725004615","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Хараппаратчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:BlueHarappatchi.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/ba/BlueHarappatchi.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20210802190418","caption":"На изображении · Атчи"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-on-24dbc2","title":"Tamagotchi On","ru":"Tamagotchi On","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-id-l-06561f","title":"Tamagotchi iD L","ru":"Tamagotchi iD L","kind":"device","note":""}]}